&lt 22 Q            &lt 23 W      &lt 24 E      &lt 25 R  &kp T                                                  &kp Y                &lt 25 U  &lt 24 I   &lt 23 O  &lt 22 P
&mt LEFT_CONTROL A  &kp S         &kp D         &kp F     &kp G            &kp LA(F4)             &quote_us      &kp H                &kp J     &kp K      &kp L     &lt_minus_us 21 0
&mt LEFT_SHIFT Z    &kp X         &kp C         &kp V     &kp B            &lt_equal_us 18 0      &kp BACKSPACE  &lt 26 N             &kp M     &kp COMMA  &kp DOT   &mt RIGHT_SHIFT SLASH
&kp LEFT_SHIFT      &kp LEFT_GUI  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp TAB   &mt LCTRL LANG2  &lt 20 SPACE           &lt 19 ENTER   &rlang_win 21 LANG1                                 &lt 18 ESCAPE
